    "detailed_description": "The long-lost classic puzzle from Windows XP Plus! - Package lives again here.<br>Like the original Microsoft Russian Square Plus! Edition you have to proof your ability to create matching lines of blocks before time runs out.<br>90s feeling repackaged. Cool music and sounds accompany you through the different game modes.<br>Numerous simple but also more demanding achievements complete the gaming experience.<br>Compete with others in <strong>Square Games Leaderboard</strong><br><br><strong>Gameplay:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use the keyboard, mouse or touchdevice to move the active block around and push it into the <i><strong>Square</strong></i> so that all the blocks in a row or column match. When the blocks match , the row or column disappears.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411030/extras/43f6a743591517374804bb1d58bf6813.poster.avif?t=1601504195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411030/extras/43f6a743591517374804bb1d58bf6813.webm?t=1601504195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411030/extras/43f6a743591517374804bb1d58bf6813.mp4?t=1601504195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>When all blocks are eliminated, you move up to the next level.<br></li><li>The higher the level of difficulty, the shorter the time you have to solve the level.</li></ul><br><strong>Game modes:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic: 9 Level - like back then<br></li><li>Arcarde: endless mode</li></ul>",
